Browser automation compatibility
--------------------------------

The browser automation compatibility layer in crates/flowmux-browser was
reimplemented with reference to cmux's GPL-3.0-or-later implementation
(https://github.com/manaflow-ai/cmux):

    Copyright (c) 2024-present Manaflow, Inc.

It was modified for Rust/WebKitGTK in 2026.

Third-party components
----------------------

Runtime dependencies retain their own licenses; see
THIRD_PARTY_LICENSES.md for the dependency license inventory generated
from Cargo metadata.

Built-in theme colors and the default terminal palette retain their own
licenses and attribution; see THIRD_PARTY_ASSET_NOTICES.md.

The image viewer links the system ThorVG library (MIT), which is
installed separately (see scripts/install-thorvg.sh) and, like GTK,
libadwaita, and WebKitGTK, retains its own distribution license.
